{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/pulls/7","id":4974238079,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVTwlwc8AAAABKHzZfw","html_url":"https://github.com/sdougbrown/paddock/pull/7","diff_url":"https://github.com/sdougbrown/paddock/pull/7.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sdougbrown/paddock/pull/7.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/issues/7","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/pulls/7/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/pulls/7/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/issues/7/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdougbrown/paddock/statuses/4ca450e9f4a02b807276218e072970fdbfb3f87a","number":7,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"🗺️ Resolve profiles and specs into a plan","user":{"login":"sdougbrown","id":2266707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjY3MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2266707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown","html_url":"https://github.com/sdougbrown","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Stack: part 7 of 11 for paddock v1. Base: `pr/06-plan-chain`. Plan: ~/Code/_notes/plans/agents/paddock-v1.md.\n\nAdds the resolver that turns a profile and a spec chain into a Plan, and `paddock plan`, which prints it as JSON for review.\n\n- Spec selection: `--spec`, else the workspace's git origin when `projects/<owner>/<repo>.toml` exists, else the profile's `default_spec`, else an error naming what was tried. Origin URLs in errors have credentials removed.\n- Mounts: the workspace (symlink-resolved) first, then `workspace.readonly` subpaths, which must resolve to a directory inside the workspace, then profile and spec read-only mounts. A read-only mount that equals or contains the workspace, or a path with `:`, is an error.\n- Workdir: the caller's directory when it lies inside the workspace, else the workspace.\n- Network: the profile's egress set names resolve against the chain's `[egress]`. An allowlist phase with no sets, or whose sets define no hosts, is an error.\n- Setup phase:\n  - The workspace follows the profile's mode; a read-only profile cannot resolve the setup phase.\n  - `file:` and `env:` sources are dropped, and no Claude state is passed.\n  - The dependency cache is `~/.cache/paddock/<spec>/<hash of the workdir's cache_key file>`, mounted read-write at the spec's `cache_dir`. The key file must be a regular file inside the workdir, at most 64 MiB.\n  - `cache_dir` must lie under `/var/cache/paddock/` and must not overlap another mount.\n  - The completion marker and a lock file live outside the mounted directory; concurrent setups for one cache serialize on the lock.\n  - SECURITY.md residual risk 7: the cache is shared between workspaces with the same spec and lockfile. AGENTS.md names it as the one rw mount a spec can cause.\n- `claude.skills` and `claude.agents` must lie in a read-only mount with no symlink between the mount and the path.\n- Plan mounts cannot target `/run/paddock`, `/run/paddock-secrets`, `/run/paddock-log`, or `/opt/paddock`.\n- `paddock plan` has a CLI test against the testdata config root.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T21:16:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T18:48:10Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"299cfea93f559ea876ffa822294baadde9bfb52b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"sdougbrown:pr/07-resolver","ref":"pr/07-resolver","repo":{"id":1430005185,"node_id":"R_kgDOVTwlwQ","name":"paddock","full_name":"sdougbrown/paddock","owner":{"login":"sdougbrown","id":2266707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjY3MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2266707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown","html_url":"https://github.com/sdougbrown","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdougbrown/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"🎠 Sandbox one command: mounts, limits, and network for agent runs","homepage":"","language":"Go","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":5,"open_issues":5,"size":295,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_discussions":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"